  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This book was produced by Andrew Huot in the Borowsky Center for Publication Arts at the University of the Arts in Philadelphia, PA in the fall of 2007. It is printed offset on Cougar 98 Bright. Thanks to Lori Spencer for her help and advice. Produced in an edition of 100, this is number 22."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Accordion fold book, when unfolded contains black and white photographic images of houses on one side, suburban houses to city row homes (left to right) and on the verso contains black and white images of two maps, Portland, Oregon on left and Philadelphia, Pennsylvania on right. Solid green color is overlaid on foliage and vegetation with the left side of recto and verso getting progressively less green than right side -- fading to gray.</subfield>
  </datafield>
